        <mxCell id="flow-text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=5;" value="1. SharePoint Indexer crawls document libraries (incremental sync)&lt;br&gt;2. Documents cracked, chunked, and vectorized into AI Search index&lt;br&gt;3. User asks question via Web App or Microsoft Teams&lt;br&gt;4. Foundry Agent receives query, calls Foundry IQ via MCP&lt;br&gt;5. Foundry IQ decomposes query → hybrid search → semantic rerank&lt;br&gt;6. Agent generates grounded answer with source citations&lt;br&gt;7. Response returned to user with clickable SharePoint links" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="165" width="470" x="1165" y="660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
